  "description": "Koh Yang-Seo, the star center fielder for the Servals, always treated his junior teammate, Kang Ha-Joo, like a younger brother—until he discovered Ha-Joo’s secret: he’s gay. When Yang-Seo catches him using a dating app, he becomes overly protective, determined to keep an eye on his innocent junior. But his watchful eye leads to unexpected closeness: the same team, the same field, and now... the same bed?!\n\nWait a second. Something’s definitely off here...!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Notes: Part of Blühen's Hageukasang (하극상) Short Story Collection or Downfall Collection in English.*",
